item.text:
Source landscape: the 2023 Abiy Ahmed/Ethiopia conflict universe is concentrated in four clusters: northern-war accountability and ceasefire implementation, the Amhara escalation and state of emergency, Oromia conflict and counterinsurgency, and transitional-justice / post-conflict governance documents. I found a mix of UN, AU, Ethiopian official, U.S. government, NGO, humanitarian, think-tank, and local-news candidates, including several metadata-only or inaccessible records that should be preserved for later inspection.

